    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Commodi cogito solio aranea delectus brevis.\"\n  slug: \"cura-canis-arcus\"\n  author: {\n    name: \"Dr. Leopoldo O'Hara\"\n    avatar: \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/faker-js/assets-person-portrait/female/512/65.jpg\"\n    bio: \"schnitzel enthusiast, author\"\n  }\n  date: \"2026-07-07\"\n  tags: [\n    \"elver\"\n    \"forgery\"\n    \"futon\"\n  ]\n\n  published: true\n  reading_time: \"13 min\"\n  summary: \"Alveus textilis clamo tergiversatio comparo arcesso adduco astrum. Caelum coerceo anser sustineo desparatus cras defleo summopere depraedor vilitas. Adaugeo subnecto bestia tertius ulciscor verto.\"\n}"
