    description: "A cooking recipe with ingredients and steps."
    shapeIndex: 3
    mamlText: "{\n  title: \"Herbes De Provence-rubbed Crocodile Salad\"\n  servings: 8\n  prep_time: \"39 minutes\"\n  cook_time: \"94 minutes\"\n\n  # Ingredients\n  ingredients: [\n    \"4 tbsp lotus root\"\n    \"4 tsp sweet potato\"\n    \"3 oz watermelon\"\n    \"2 lbs enoki mushrooms\"\n    \"3 cups achacha\"\n  ]\n\n  # Instructions\n  steps: [\n    \"A succulent chicken steak, encased in a smoky balti masala crust, served with a side of mace mashed dried chinese broccoli.\"\n    \"A simple cavalo pie. No fancy stuff. Just pie.\"\n    \"Hearty pumpkin and duck stew, slow-cooked with kaffir leaves and bok choy for a comforting, flavorful meal.\"\n    \"Fresh mixed greens tossed with bay leaves-rubbed quail, potatoes, and a light dressing.\"\n    \"A simple banana pie. No fancy stuff. Just pie.\"\n    \"A robust tangy stew featuring Anglo-Indian flavors, loaded with sour meat, smoky vegetables, and a salty, creamy broth.\"\n    \"Savor the rich flavors of creamy cauliflower, complemented by loquat and cumin.\"\n  ]\n\n  nutrition: {\n    calories: 586\n    protein: \"40g\"\n    carbs: \"36g\"\n    fat: \"23g\"\n  }\n}"
